## CLI Specification

The CLI enables scripting and serves as the backend for the Claude Code plugin.

```bash
tome [command] [options]

Commands:
  add <url|path>       Add documentation source (interactive)
  pull [source]        Fetch/update documentation
  list                 List all sources
  search <query>       Search documentation
  remove <source>      Remove a source
  config [source]      View/edit configuration
  serve                Start local API server
  mcp                  Start MCP server
  status               Show sync and index status
  export               Export bookmarks/annotations

Options:
  --json               Output as JSON (for scripting)
  --quiet              Suppress non-essential output
  --config <path>      Use alternate config file
  --help               Show help

Examples:
  tome add https://docs.python.org/3/
  tome pull --all
  tome search "async iterator" --scope rust
  tome list --json | jq '.[] | select(.category == "Rust")'
```

